#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:15
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:17
msgid ""
"This tutorial introduces you to the basics of :ref:`piocore` Command Line "
"Interface (CLI) workflow and shows you a creation process of a simple cross-"
"platform “Blink” Project. After finishing you will have a general "
"understanding of how to work with the multiple development platforms and "
"embedded boards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:23
msgid "Setting Up the Project"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:25
msgid ""
":ref:`piocore` provides special :ref:`cmd_project_init` command for "
"configuring your projects. It allows one to initialize new empty project or "
"update existing with the new data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:28
msgid ""
"What is more, :ref:`cmd_project_init` can be used for :ref:`ide`. It means "
"that you will be able to import pre-generated PlatformIO project using "
"favorite IDE and extend it with the professional instruments for IoT "
"development."
msgstr ""

