#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:221
msgid "Process Project"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:223
msgid ""
":ref:`piocore` provides special :ref:`cmd_run` command to process project. "
"If you call it without any arguments, PlatformIO Build System will process "
"all project environments (which were created per each board specified "
"above). Here are a few useful commands:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:228
msgid ""
"``pio run``. Process (build) all environments specified in :ref:`projectconf`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:230
msgid ""
"``pio run --target upload``. Build project and upload firmware to the all "
"devices specified in :ref:`projectconf`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:232
msgid "``pio run --target clean``. Clean project (delete compiled objects)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:233
msgid "``pio run -e uno``. Process only ``uno`` environment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:234
msgid ""
"``pio run -e uno -t upload``. Build project only for ``uno`` and upload "
"firmware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/quickstart.rst:237
msgid ""
"Please follow to :option:`pio run --list-targets` documentation for the "
"other targets."
msgstr ""

